        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"mk\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Како да ги миете рацете?</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px 30px 0 30px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 68px;\n    line-height: 1.05;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 10px 0 18px 0;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n  }\n  h1 .gray { color: #9d9d9d; }\n  .subtitle {\n    color: #8c8c8c;\n    font-size: 23px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  .duration {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 38px;\n  }\n  .clock {\n    width: 42px;\n    height: 42px;\n    background: #6b6b6b;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  .clock .placeholder {\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 34px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 2px solid #ffffff;\n    font-size: 5px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .duration .label {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .duration .value {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #9d9d9d;\n  }\n  .grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    column-gap: 40px;\n    row-gap: 30px;\n  }\n  .step .figure {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 175px;\n    background: #ebebeb;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .step .num {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 42px;\n    height: 42px;\n    background: #6b6b6b;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .step .placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 42px;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #b0b0b0;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .step .caption {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .footer-bar {\n    margin-top: 60px;\n    background: #f26522;\n    padding: 26px 0 18px 0;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .footer-bar .placeholder {\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 90px;\n    margin: 0 auto 6px auto;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .footer-bar .ministry {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .credits {\n    background: #b3b3b3;\n    color: #f2f2f2;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    padding: 12px 20px 14px 20px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1>Како да ги <span class=\"gray\">миете</span> рацете?</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"subtitle\">\n    КОГА РАЦЕТЕ&nbsp; СЕ ВИДЛИВО НЕЧИСТИ, ИЗМИЈТЕ ГИ!<br>\n    ВО СПРОТИВНО, МОЖЕТЕ ДА ГИ ИСТРИЕТЕ СО ДЕЗИНФИЦИЕНС ЗА РАЦЕ\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"duration\">\n    <div class=\"clock\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: clock]</div></div>\n    <span class=\"label\">Времетраење на целата постапка:</span>\n    <span class=\"value\">40-60 секунди</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">0</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: hands under running tap]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Навлажнете ги рацете со вода;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">1</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: soap dispenser over hand]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Нанесете доволно сапун за да ја покриете целата површина на рацете;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">2</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: palm to palm with rotating arrow]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Истријте ги дланките една од друга;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">3</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: right palm over back of left hand, interlaced fingers]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Поставете ја десната дланка врз надворешната страна на левата шака и тријте со испреплетени прсти, и обратно;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">4</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: palm to palm with fingers interlaced, crossed arrows]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Истријте ги дланките со испреплетени прсти;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">5</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: backs of fingers to opposing palm, double arrows]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Истријте ги внатрешните страни на прстите една од друга;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">6</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: rotational rubbing of left thumb]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Со ротациски движења истријте го левиот палец со десната рака и обратно;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">7</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: rotational rubbing of fingertips in left palm]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Со споени прсти на десната рака со ротациски движења налево и надесно истријте ја левата дланка и обратно;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">8</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: rinsing hands with water]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Исплакнете ги рацете со вода;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">9</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: drying hands with single-use towel]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Добро избришете ги рацете со крпа за една употреба;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">10</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: closing tap with the towel]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Со истата крпа затворете ја славината;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">11</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: two clean open hands]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Вашите раце се чисти.</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"footer-bar\">\n  <div class=\"placeholder\">[Emblem: coat of arms, centered]</div>\n  <div class=\"ministry\">МИНИСТЕРСТВО<br>ЗА ЗДРАВСТВО</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"credits\">\n  Моите 5 моменти за хигиена на рацете<br>\n  'Базирано на: 'My 5 moments for Hand Hygiene',<br>\n  URL: http://www.who.int/gpsc/5may/background/5moments/en/index.html © World Health Organization 2009'. Сите права се задржани'.\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
